{
    "attributes": {
        "action": "Ban surface dressing as a method of road repair",
        "additional_details": "As a motorcyclist myself, I believe that Surface Dressing is not conducive to a safe method of passage for motorcyclists or cyclists, even at 20mph. In my experience roads which have been surface dressed are akin to sheet ice.",
        "background": "In our view, our roads are in an appalling state of repair but we do not believe that the practice of Surface Dressing is the solution. We think it\u2019s a dangerous solution for all road users, especially motorcyclists and cyclists. I call on the government to ban this method of road repair.",
